    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.38,
      "text": "What can outcomes tell you about a modernization plan?"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.2,
      "end": 8.98,
      "text": "Measure presents Baseline, Target, and Observed values so you can discuss assumptions"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.98,
      "end": 12.435792,
      "text": "and differences in the chosen disposition's context."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.435792,
      "end": 16.175792,
      "text": "They are not readings from a live production telemetry, billing, or"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.982715076923075,
      "end": 17.815792,
      "text": "benefits-realization integration."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.815792,
      "end": 23.335791999999998,
      "text": "Learn presents representative archetype lessons and lets you capture a session-only"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.335791999999998,
      "end": 23.895792,
      "text": "note."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.375791999999997,
      "end": 29.155791999999998,
      "text": "Describe the assumption, observed difference, lesson, and possible relevance to"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.155791999999998,
      "end": 29.915791999999996,
      "text": "future work."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.915791999999996,
      "end": 35.275791999999996,
      "text": "Session notes do not retrain the agents or automatically change recommendations."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.495791999999994,
      "end": 41.71579199999999,
      "text": "Next, use these views to structure a review, then validate real outcomes in your"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.71579199999999,
      "end": 42.675791999999994,
      "text": "approved systems."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.375792,
      "end": 48.25579199999999,
      "text": "Any future recommendation still requires current evidence and human authority."
    }
  ],
